hadiths[13]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1915","[AI-translation] Adi bin Haatim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mizraaq key shikaar key baarey mein poochha. Aap ne farmaya: Jo uski dhaar se lagey use khaao. Aur jo uski chaudi taraf se lagey wo ghoot kar maara hua hai. Aur main ne Aap se kuttay key shikaar key baarey mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo wo tumhaarey liye rokay use khaao. Beshak kuttay ka pakadna zibah hai. Aur agar tum apne kuttay ya apne kutton key sath doosra kutta paao aur tumhey khauf ho ke wo uskey sath usey pakad chuka hai jabke us ne use qatl kar diya hai to na khaao. Beshak tum ne Allah ka naam apne kuttay par liya tha aur uskey siwa par nahi liya tha. (Bukhari: 5475)"
"1916","[AI-translation] Abu Salaaba Khushani (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ae Allah key Nabi! Beshak ham Kitaab walon ki qaum ki zameen mein hain. To kya ham unkey bartanon mein khaaen? Aur shikaar ki zameen mein hun. Main apni kaman se aur apne ghair sikhaaye kuttey se aur apne sikhaaye kuttey se shikaar karta hun. To merey liye kya durust hai? Aap ne farmaya: Lekin jo tum ne Kitaab walon ka zikr kya, agar tum unkey siwa paao to un mein na khaao. Aur agar na paao to unhey dho lo aur un mein khaao. Aur jo tum ne apni kaman se shikaar kya aur tum ne Allah ka naam liya to khaao. Aur jo tum ne apne sikhaaye kuttey se shikaar kya aur tum ne Allah ka naam liya to khaao. Aur jo tum ne apne ghair sikhaaye kuttey se shikaar kya aur tum ne uska zibah paa liya to khaao. (Bukhari: 5478)"
"1917","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mughaffal (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne aadmi ko kankari phenktey huey dekha. To us se kaha: Kankari na phenko! Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kankari phenkney se mana kya tha. Ya kankari phenkney ko naapasand kartey they. Aur farmaya: Beshak us se shikaar nahi kya jaata aur na dushman ko zakhm lagta hai. Lekin wo daant tod sakti hai aur aankh phod sakti hai. Phir usey uskey baad kankari phenktey huey dekha. To us se kaha: Main tumhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan karta hun ke Aap ne kankari phenkney se mana kya tha. Ya use naapasand kya tha. Aur tum kankari phenktey ho? Main tum se itna itna baat na karunga. (Bukhari: 5479)"
"1918","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo kutta rakkhey jo maweshi ka kutta nahi hai ya shikaari nahi hai, uskey amal mein se har din do qeeraat kam hotey hain. (Bukhari: 5480)"
"1919","[AI-translation] Adi bin Haatim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo qareeb guzar chuki hai aur is riwayat mein badhaa diya: Aur agar tum ne shikaar ko teer maara aur use aik ya do din key baad paaya jabke us mein tumhaarey teer key nishaan key siwa nahi hai to khaao. Aur agar wo paani mein gira to na khaao. (Bukhari: 5485)"
"1920","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Aufa (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath saat ghazwe kiye. Ya chhe. Ham Aap key sath tiddi khaatey they. (Bukhari: 5495)"
"1921","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr ki beti Asma (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein ghoda zibah kya aur use khaaya. (Bukhari: 5512)"
"1922","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo giroh key paas se guzrey jinhon-ne murghi nasb ki thi jise wo teer maar rahey they. Phir jab unhon-ne use dekha to us se muntashir ho gaey. To Ibn Umar ne kaha: Ye kis ne kya? Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us par laanat ki jo ye karey. (Bukhari: 5515)"
"1923","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) aik riwayat mein hai: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us par laanat ki jo jaanwar ko misaal banaaey."
"1924","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko murghi khaatey huey dekha. (Bukhari: 5517)"
"1925","[AI-translation] Abu Salaaba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne darindon mein har daant waley ka gosht khaaney se mana kya. (Bukhari: 5530)"
"1926","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Nek aur burey saathi ki misaal musk uthaane waley aur bhatti phoonkne waley jaisi hai. To musk uthaane wala ya tumhey deyga ya tum us se khareedogey ya tum us se umda khushbu paaogey. Aur bhatti phoonkne wala ya tumhaarey kapdey jalaayega ya tum kharaab boo paaogey. (Bukhari: 5534)"
"1927","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya ke tasweer par maara jaey. (Bukhari: 5541). Qurbaniyon ki kitaab."
